values
  ('4fc0723d-0223-5a8c-98a4-27a0c102403a', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g7-argument-writing'), null, 'easy',
   $q$Which transition best fills the blank at the beginning of sentence (5)?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Meanwhile,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"time-for-result"},{"text":"Therefore,","is_correct":true},{"text":"However,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contrast-for-result"},{"text":"For example,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-for-result"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Therefore,$q$, $q$Sentence (5) tells what follows from the quick repair times in sentence (4), so "Therefore" shows the result. "However" would signal a contrast, but sentence (5) agrees with sentence (4).$q$, 'draft', '7ae270f9-354d-5e65-a996-1c19e1be7c85')
