  ('ae036e02-424e-55d6-8a64-2425168789c7', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g7-argument-writing'), null, 'medium',
   $q$How does the writer answer the concern in sentence (7)?$q$, $q$[{"text":"by limiting the desk to simple tasks and pointing to a school where a similar desk caused no damage","is_correct":true},{"text":"by saying that parents do not understand how laptops work","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"dismissive-tone"},{"text":"by admitting that a student help desk is probably a bad idea","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-concession"},{"text":"by giving the percentage of quick repairs from the technician's log","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-evidence-location"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$by limiting the desk to simple tasks and pointing to a school where a similar desk caused no damage$q$, $q$Sentences (8) and (9) answer the worry with a safety rule and an example from Pine Hill. The repair percentage in sentence (4) supports the claim but does not address possible damage.$q$, 'draft', '7ae270f9-354d-5e65-a996-1c19e1be7c85')
