-- Passage wg7-argument-writing-p06
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('70fcefbf-c1f5-532e-ac30-8d490034c0d7', 'wg7-argument-writing-p06', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g7-argument-writing'), null,
        '6-8', $q$A New Language for Oakdale$q$, $q$(1) Oakdale Middle School offers Spanish and French, but students who want to learn American Sign Language have no option. (2) Oakdale should add American Sign Language as a seventh grade elective. (3) Sign language allows students to communicate with deaf and hard of hearing people in our community. (4) Our town has a school for the deaf only three miles away, and its students often visit our library and parks. (5) Learning to sign also builds visual memory, because students must remember hand shapes, movements, and facial expressions. (6) Some students think sign language looks interesting.

(7) Some teachers argue that the school cannot afford to hire another language teacher. (8) This is a fair point. (9) However, the deaf school's outreach program has offered to send an instructor twice a week at no cost. (10) Our band concert last month raised money for new music stands.

(11) Sign language is a beautiful language. (12) It would be cool to learn.$q$, 'draft')
