-- Passage wg7-narrative-writing-p06
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('01a7b91b-2371-5f77-a4e9-ecf6f09af0f4', 'wg7-narrative-writing-p06', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g7-narrative-writing'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Centering the Clay$q$, $q$(1) The first time I sat at the pottery wheel in art club, I thought making a bowl would take five minutes. (2) Mr. Nakamura slapped a lump of wet clay onto the center of the wheel and stepped back. (3) I pressed my foot on the pedal, and the wheel began to spin. (4) As soon as I touched the clay, it wobbled and flung a gray splatter across my apron. (5) Some clay is dug from riverbanks in several states. (6) I pushed harder, but the lump only leaned farther to one side.

(7) Mr. Nakamura watched me struggle. (8) He told me to brace my elbows against my knees and let the wheel do the work. (9) I tried it. (10) Slowly, the wobble shrank until the clay spun smooth and still under my palms. (11) Then I pressed my thumbs into the center and pulled the walls upward. (12) My bowl was lopsided and a little thick on one side. (13) Still, it was mine.

(14) That is what happened at pottery.$q$, 'draft')
