   $q$Which transition best fills the blank at the beginning of sentence 9?$q$, $q$[{"text":"On the other hand,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contrast-for-cause"},{"text":"Thanks to this new line,","is_correct":true},{"text":"For example,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-for-cause"},{"text":"Long before then,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-time-order"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Thanks to this new line,$q$, $q$The telegraph line in sentence 8 is what made fast messages possible, so "Thanks to this new line" shows the cause and effect. "Long before then" is wrong because messages could only travel in minutes after the line was finished.$q$, 'draft', '40da26bc-69c6-548d-a444-7a1e2d91e132')
