   $q$Which sentence best fills blank (2) as the claim of the draft?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Moreau shows that sharing music can bring family members from different generations closer together.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Moreau's story takes place over the course of one long summer.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"The steel pan is a musical instrument that people play by striking it with sticks.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"topic-not-claim"},{"text":"Darnell should spend much less time playing video games after school.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opinion-not-analysis"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Moreau shows that sharing music can bring family members from different generations closer together.$q$, $q$The draft traces how one song connects Darnell, Grandpa, and Grandpa's father, so a claim about music bringing generations together fits. The summer setting is true, but it is a small detail, not a point the evidence proves.$q$, 'draft', '32c27476-9174-52e9-8910-68cf08a3b31b')
