insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('f5d01310-a26e-5090-a2cd-421816622548', 'wg7-writing-with-evidence-p08', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g7-writing-with-evidence'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Draft: Cooler Roofs$q$, $q$(1) Abena Mensah's article "Cooler Roofs, Cooler Cities" explains how painting roofs a light color can help cities stay cooler in summer. (2) ____. (3) Mensah explains that dark roofs soak up sunlight and turn it into heat. (4) She reports that on one hot afternoon, "a black roof measured 150 degrees, while a white roof nearby measured 95 degrees." (5) That is a big difference.

(6) Mensah also describes how cooler roofs help the people inside the buildings. (7) In one apartment building that painted its roof white, residents ran their air conditioners less often. (8) Mensah writes that the building's electric bills "dropped by about one fifth over the summer." (9) In addition, some cities now pay part of the cost for families who want to paint their roofs. (10) Mensah does point out that white roofs must be cleaned every few years, or they slowly turn gray and lose some of their cooling power. (11) Still, her evidence shows that light roofs are a simple way to fight summer heat.$q$, 'draft')
