   $q$Which sentence best fills blank (2) as the claim of the draft?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Mensah shows that black roofs look much nicer than white roofs do.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"This article is about roofs and the different colors they can be painted.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"topic-not-claim"},{"text":"Everyone should move to a city where all of the roofs are painted white.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opinion-not-analysis"},{"text":"Mensah shows that light roofs keep buildings cooler and help the people inside save energy.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Mensah shows that light roofs keep buildings cooler and help the people inside save energy.$q$, $q$Paragraph 1 shows the roof temperatures and paragraph 2 shows lower energy use, so the claim about cooler buildings and saved energy fits both. The choice about roof colors only names the topic without making a point.$q$, 'draft', 'f5d01310-a26e-5090-a2cd-421816622548')
